nako -- python vulnerability detection
02f754064dce1a8c2b4b301f25c43b44fe2bbfd

1. Setting up Nix(package manager)
```bash
# download and install nix package manager
# https://nixos.org/download/
sudo dnf install nix
# enable flakes
# edit /etc/nix/nix.conf
experimental-features = nix-command flakes
``

2. Setting up development environment
```bash
git clone git@github.com:reddykartik/nako.git
cd nako
nix develop
```

